<header><p class="st-kicker">chiefdom · France and the Low Countries</p><h1 class="st-title">Elusates</h1><p class="st-meta">300 BCE – 56 BCE (approx.) · capital Elusa</p></header>
<p class="st-teaser">Aquitanian people of the Armagnac whose town Elusa, modern Eauze, became a provincial capital of late Roman Gaul.</p>
<div class="st-body"><div class="st-text"><h2>Origins</h2><p>The Elusates lived in the north-west of the modern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/gers">Gers</a>, in the <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/county-of-armagnac">Armagnac</a> hills. Caesar names them among the Aquitanian peoples who surrendered to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/publius-licinius-crassus">Publius Crassus</a> in 56 BCE.</p><h2>Rule and society</h2><p>Nothing is known of their pre-Roman government. They belonged to the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/aquitani">Aquitani</a>, whose language was related to Basque.</p><h2>Decline and legacy</h2><p>Under <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rome">Rome</a> <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/elusa">Elusa</a> grew into a prosperous town, and in the late 3rd century it became the capital of the province of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/novempopulania">Novempopulana</a>. The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/eauze">Eauze</a> treasure, a hoard of nearly 28,000 coins and jewellery buried in the 3rd century, shows its wealth.</p><p class="st-conf">Few sources survive for this state; details are uncertain.</p></div><aside class="st-side"><figure class="st-fig"><img src="/images/states/elusates.jpg" alt="Elusates" width="320" height="274"><figcaption>Image: Sémhur · CC BY-SA 4.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Aquitani_tribes_map-fr.svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">source</a></figcaption></figure><dl class="st-facts"><dt>Years</dt><dd>300 BCE – 56 BCE (approx.)</dd><dt>Centuries</dt><dd><a href="/centuries/4th-century-bce">4th century BCE</a> – <a href="/centuries/1st-century-bce">1st century BCE</a></dd><dt>Type</dt><dd>chiefdom</dd><dt>Character</dt><dd>tribal</dd><dt>Capital</dt><dd>Elusa</dd><dt>Language</dt><dd>Aquitanian</dd><dt>Today</dt><dd><a href="/countries/france">France</a></dd></dl><figure class="st-locator"><a href="/atlas?year=-178&amp;focus=elusates" aria-label="Elusates on the atlas"><svg class="map map-loc" viewBox="4682 624 640 512" role="img" aria-label="Map: where Elusates lay"><image href="/maps/world.svg" x="0" y="0" width="10000" height="4393"/><path class="map-tie" d="M5002 880L5304 942"/><path class="map-dot-n" d="M5304 942h0"/><path class="map-dot-halo" d="M5002 880h0"/><path class="map-dot-me" d="M5002 880h0"/></svg></a><figcaption>The dot marks Elusa. <a href="/atlas?year=-178&amp;focus=elusates">On the atlas &rarr;</a></figcaption></figure></aside></div>

